      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6197204::rubric_mechanisms::004::f275591f70"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cr dilutes the ferromagnetic moments of other alloying elements, particularly Co and Fe.",
