      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6197204::rubric_mechanisms::004::f275591f70"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Cr-induced reduction in ferromagnetic moments and saturation magnetization causes an increase in coercive field.",
